{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4bc31686244bbcbc029b9a5c2fefbb666bfe4a94b81c6ab77cebf07700db4934", "ja": "（まつり達の海外ロケが終わり、劇場に戻ってきた。\n仕事の息抜きに、少し散歩でもしようかな……）", "zh": "（茉莉她们的海外取景工作结束后，回到了剧场。工作之余，要不要稍微散散步呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "b63e7a7ce4e9e03443976d18ba46c7c561541ea11f03a109757d53a512209692", "ja": "こんにちは、{$P$}さん♪\nこんなところで、何をしているのです？", "zh": "你好，{$P$}先生♪\n你在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5b39913d7117ffafb418c45deb006117825a1fc729a71953e7bdd4f0c327563", "ja": "お疲れさま、まつり。\n休憩にきたんだけど……まつりこそ、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，茉莉。\n我来休息一下……倒是茉莉，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "772e193906dbd4a6e594c72aec1a01e58f654dc388a71296597329cb52e3607d", "ja": "姫も同じなのです。\nちょっとだけ、外の風に当たっていたのですよ。", "zh": "公主也是一样的哦。\n只是稍微来吹吹外面的风罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "fedad21624857029cbae777c4f0550eda64b8696b8a61ee475fb0e4902e9290e", "ja": "今日は、風が気持ちよくて……\nこの前のロケのことを思い出していたのです。", "zh": "今天的风吹得很舒服……\n所以想起了前阵子外景拍摄的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1005_p", "source_sha256": "989d0d0359326645062730a94c71bf8bced01b5fefa044ae703096f37d95d456", "ja": "ロケの？", "zh": "外景拍摄？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "3a023d2857c12145a5a22dfcab6dabdab4023784640e5069d1bc8b8b7a3d6670", "ja": "はいなのです。オフの日に、\n麗花ちゃんの運転で、海まで行ったのです。", "zh": "是的。休息日那天，坐着丽花开车去了海边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "811533306c4d754c1d48815353a73e3767d58197f1a822402182028d893e1fa8", "ja": "みんなでいっぱい笑って、たくさん話をして……\n姫はとっても楽しかったのです♪", "zh": "大家一起尽情欢笑，聊了好多好多……公主开心极了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a053fa20237120ec2e7209e69f6019f694e82f8ee7a084b2b4ee01e7b8c88cae", "ja": "俺は別件で行けなかったけど……そうか。\nいい思い出になったみたいだな。", "zh": "我因为另有事情没能去……这样啊。看来成了段美好的回忆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "e9b320421903a42a21ee18566476bb5312f96ac57923d73e54f76207e7d99815", "ja": "それなのですよ、{$P$}さん！\n姫は、それが心残りだったのです！", "zh": "就是这个呀，{$P$}先生！公主对此一直很遗憾呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1010_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "3af911c37dd4e757c54199a387ed1fcb430c1124e96959b8f0b699b11d84eaba", "ja": "あの時、姫は{$P$}さんと一緒に\n海に行きたかったのです……。", "zh": "那时候，公主想和{$P$}先生一起去海边的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "eb01a20614ff414041fcb473765d99142b5d1f81e7a74a4489ba5833587554c5", "ja": "でも、仕方ないのはわかっているのです……。\n姫達のために、お仕事を頑張っているのですから。", "zh": "不过，姬知道这是没办法的事……因为您是为了姬们而努力工作的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "fce6069fa66ecc2b0e7ec11d43e30a00b640a8372a40488755dd6f6f51daf6cd", "ja": "だから、{$P$}さん？\n今から少しだけ、姫とお散歩しませんか？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生？现在要不要陪公主稍微散散步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fca7d1020e776e76adef92286b71776569d608fb7c2f3449b320f609af71165c", "ja": "それは構わないけど……でも、どうして散歩を？", "zh": "我倒是没意见……不过，为什么要去散步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "32482e3fe39fb588a5c394d18f9d5d74a8632ccb28a98e23211fdc2793bd64a3", "ja": "ひとりでいるよりも、誰かと一緒の方が、\nいい気分転換ができると思うのです。", "zh": "比起独处，我觉得和别人一起能更好地转换心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "0baf99d8e1425523e51aaaad72f5f2a3f1775e553083cca767869ef2fb72f47a", "ja": "それに姫も、話し相手がほしかったのです！\nだから……ね？　ね？", "zh": "而且公主也想找个人聊天嘛！所以……好不好？好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0333_1017_p", "source_sha256": "89941996c2fdb902d631701c47323d168a03daa950aada8669b8705baac73b64", "ja": "（まつりと散歩をして、いい気分転換ができた……。\nまた海に行けるよう頑張ろう。その時は俺も一緒に！）", "zh": "（和茉莉一起散了步，心情得到了很好的转换……\n努力争取下次还能去海边吧。到那时我也一起去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
